#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:5
msgid "class Flash -- access to built-in flash storage"
msgstr "klasa Flash -- pristup ugrađenoj flash memoriji"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`Flash` class provides direct, block-level access to the RP2040's"
" external QSPI flash chip. The driver implements the "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` interface so it can be passed to "
":func:`vfs.mount` for custom filesystem configurations."
msgstr ""
"Klasa :class:`Flash` omogućuje izravan pristup na razini blokova vanjskom "
"QSPI flash čipu RP2040. Upravljački program implementira sučelje "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` tako da se može proslijediti funkciji "
":func:`vfs.mount` za prilagođene konfiguracije datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:12
msgid ""
"Most scripts persist data through the auto-mounted filesystem at ``/`` and "
"never construct :class:`Flash` directly. Construct one manually when you "
"need to:"
msgstr ""
"Većina skripti trajno pohranjuje podatke putem automatski montiranog "
"datotečnog sustava na ``/`` i nikada izravno ne stvara :class:`Flash`\\ . "
"Stvorite ga ručno kada trebate:"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:16
msgid ""
"Mount a non-default filesystem (e.g. wrap with :class:`vfs.VfsFat`) on a "
"custom partition."
msgstr ""
"Montirati nestandardni datotečni sustav (npr. omotati s "
":class:`vfs.VfsFat`\\ ) na prilagođenoj particiji."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:18
msgid ""
"Read or write firmware regions or factory-data blocks that aren't owned by "
"the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Čitati ili pisati u regije ugrađenog programa ili blokove tvorničkih "
"podataka koji nisu u vlasništvu datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:20
msgid ""
"Implement a custom on-flash storage format that bypasses the filesystem "
"layer."
msgstr ""
"Implementirati prilagođeni format pohrane na flash memoriji koji zaobilazi "
"sloj datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:24
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:28
msgid ""
"Return the singleton :class:`Flash` block-device object backed by the "
"RP2040's QSPI flash chip. The first block exposed is the one immediately "
"after the firmware region, so callers see only the filesystem-eligible area "
"of the chip."
msgstr ""
"Vraća jedinstveni (singleton) objekt blok-uređaja :class:`Flash` koji se "
"oslanja na QSPI flash čip RP2040. Prvi izloženi blok je onaj neposredno "
"nakon regije ugrađenog programa, pa pozivatelji vide samo područje čipa "
"pogodno za datotečni sustav."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:34
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:39
msgid ""
"Read bytes from the flash into ``buf``. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Čita bajtove iz flash memorije u ``buf``\\ . Standardna ulazna točka blok-"
"uređaja :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` koju koristi sloj datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): read whole blocks starting"
" at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of the flash "
"block size."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): čita cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): read "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. Used by littlefs and other "
"byte-addressable filesystems."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): čita "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . Koristi se kod littlefs i drugih "
"datotečnih sustava koji se adresiraju po bajtu."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:56
msgid ""
"Write bytes from ``buf`` to the flash. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Piše bajtove iz ``buf`` u flash memoriju. Standardna ulazna točka blok-"
"uređaja :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` koju koristi sloj datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): write whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the flash block size. Each affected block is erased automatically before "
"being written."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): piše cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine flash bloka. Svaki zahvaćeni blok automatski se briše "
"prije zapisivanja."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): write "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. **No implicit erase** is "
"performed -- the caller must ensure the affected blocks have been erased via"
" a prior ``ioctl(6, block_num)`` call."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): piše "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . **Nema implicitnog brisanja** -- "
"pozivatelj mora osigurati da su zahvaćeni blokovi prethodno obrisani putem "
"poziva ``ioctl(6, block_num)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:75
msgid ""
"Standard :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` control entry point. Called by the "
"filesystem layer at mount/unmount time and on every sync. Recognised ``cmd``"
" values:"
msgstr ""
"Standardna upravljačka ulazna točka :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ . Poziva"
" je sloj datotečnog sustava pri montiranju/demontiranju i pri svakoj "
"sinkronizaciji. Prepoznate vrijednosti ``cmd``\\ :"

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:79
msgid "``1`` -- initialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``1`` -- inicijalizacija. Vraća ``0`` pri uspjehu."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:80
msgid "``2`` -- deinitialise. Returns ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``2`` -- deinicijalizacija. Vraća ``0`` pri uspjehu."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:81
msgid "``3`` -- sync pending writes. Returns ``0``."
msgstr "``3`` -- sinkronizacija zapisivanja na čekanju. Vraća ``0``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:82
msgid "``4`` -- return the number of flash blocks visible to the filesystem."
msgstr "``4`` -- vraća broj flash blokova vidljivih datotečnom sustavu."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:84
msgid ""
"``5`` -- return the block size in bytes (typically the flash sector size, "
"``4096``)."
msgstr ""
"``5`` -- vraća veličinu bloka u bajtovima (obično veličina flash sektora, "
"``4096``\\ )."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:86
msgid ""
"``6`` -- erase the block at index ``arg``. Required before using the "
"extended ``writeblocks`` form."
msgstr ""
"``6`` -- briše blok na indeksu ``arg``\\ . Obavezno prije korištenja "
"proširenog oblika ``writeblocks``\\ ."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:88
msgid ""
"``7`` -- return whether the device supports the block erase command (``1`` "
"on RP2040)."
msgstr ""
"``7`` -- vraća podržava li uređaj naredbu brisanja bloka (\\ ``1`` na "
"RP2040)."

#: ../../library/rp2.Flash.rst:91
msgid ""
"Direct callers normally don't use this method -- the filesystem driver "
"dispatches the standard codes automatically once the :class:`Flash` is "
"mounted."
msgstr ""
"Izravni pozivatelji obično ne koriste ovu metodu -- upravljački program "
"datotečnog sustava automatski upućuje standardne kodove nakon što je "
":class:`Flash` montiran."
